        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「Altessimoの音楽に勇気をもらいました。\nこれからも応援しています！」……か。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ファンレターはありがたい。わたしたちの音楽が\n誰かに届いていることを、こうして教えてくれる。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "嬉しそうだね、麗さん。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "は、はい。いけませんね。\n本来の目的を忘れるところでした。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今回Altessimoが出るのは、\n男極『ライブパフォーマンス部門』。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "観客が求めるパフォーマンスを知るため、\nこうして手紙を読み始めたのですから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "こちらの手紙に、ご意見がありますよ。\n「Altessimoの音楽が大大大好きです！」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「もし願いが叶うなら、二人の歌声を\n耳元で聞いてみたいです！」だそうです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうか……。だが、ライブ中に\n耳元で歌うというのは難しいだろうな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だったらサビのところで、\nこの人の席まで行って歌ってあげようか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "折角ですから、マイクを渡して\n一緒に歌うのはどうでしょうか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや、いっそ、\nわたしたちの前で歌ってもらうというのも……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_b:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（元音楽家の二人にそんなことをされたら、\n相手の方が緊張してしまいそうだ……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
